### Start activity with POST (JSON body)
POST http://localhost:8080/activity/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Description": "Working on HTTP API",
  "Project": "TOCK",
  "StartTime": "2026-01-31T10:00:00Z"
}

### Start activity with GET (query parameters)
GET http://localhost:8080/activity/start?project=TOCK&description=Working%20on%20HTTP%20API

### Start activity with POST (current time)
POST http://localhost:8080/activity/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Description": "Code review",
  "Project": "TOCK"
}
